==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*čьrnъ}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*kr̥snós||black}}. Cognates include {{cog|cu|чрънъ||black}}, {{cog|bg|черен}}, {{cog|sh|црн}}/{{m|sh|crn}}, {{cog|sl|črn}}, {{cog|sk|čierny}}; Norwegian and {{cog|sv|harr||grayling}}, {{cog|sa|कृष्ण}}, and {{cog|prg|kirsnan||black}}.

